{"unit_id":"sun04222__dsh-prompt-enhance#card-zh","repo":"sun04222/dsh-prompt-enhance","commit":"a2dd8995d6280511d9dc9c82d93d0aec85634216","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-enhance 是面向 DSH Web 输入框和工具调用的提示词增强插件。它在输入框右侧提供“增强”按钮，并注册 enhance_prompt 工具，将一段草稿交给 DSH 的 LLM 服务单次改写为更清晰、具体的提示词；结果成功后可替换草稿并恢复原文。改写遵循保留原意、保持输入语言、只输出提示词且不代为回答等规则。适合整理模糊需求、发送给模型前完善任务描述，或通过工具批量逐条改写。需在 DSH 中有可用的模型路由；模型参数可按调用或插件配置选择。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:175-229","index.js:231-289","client.js:95-136"]}
{"unit_id":"sun04222__dsh-prompt-enhance#card-en","repo":"sun04222/dsh-prompt-enhance","commit":"a2dd8995d6280511d9dc9c82d93d0aec85634216","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-prompt-enhance adds a prompt rewrite button to the DSH Web composer and an enhance_prompt tool. Both use DSH’s LLM service to make a draft clearer while preserving its intent and language. The button replaces the draft and can restore the original. A usable model route is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:175-229","index.js:231-289","client.js:95-136"]}
