{"unit_id":"sun04222__dsh-prompt-enhance#feature-1","repo":"sun04222/dsh-prompt-enhance","commit":"a2dd8995d6280511d9dc9c82d93d0aec85634216","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-enhance 的功能「改写提示词」：输入框按钮和 enhance_prompt 工具把非空草稿交给 DSH LLM，以一次补全生成更清晰具体、保留原意和语言的提示词；空输入直接返回错误。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:178-229","index.js:231-249"]}
